Replace VSCode welcome walkthrough with eri-specific content.

Drops the upstream `Setup`, `SetupWeb`, `SetupAccessibility`, and `Beginner`
walkthroughs and replaces them with a single featured `EriSetup` walkthrough
whose tiles are:

  1. Sign in to eri (hero — Sign in + Continue without account)
  2. Try inline edit (Cmd-K)
  3. Open chat (Cmd-L)
  4. Import from VS Code
  5. Open folder (mac + non-mac variants)
  6. Clone repo

The `notebooks` walkthrough is preserved as it is gated by a notebook setting.
`startEntries` (the recents/quick-open column) is unchanged.

